        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>合并所有者权益变动表（续）——中国中车股份有限公司2024年年度报告</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", serif;\n    color: #000;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 1120px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 30px 60px 30px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .running-head {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    padding-bottom: 6px;\n    border-bottom: 1.5px solid #000;\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n  h1.doc-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  .subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n  }\n  .prep-unit {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .unit-line {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n    padding-right: 8px;\n  }\n  table.fin {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n  }\n  table.fin th, table.fin td {\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n    padding: 3px 4px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  table.fin th {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: normal;\n  }\n  table.fin td.item {\n    text-align: left;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  table.fin td.num {\n    text-align: right;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .indent1 { padding-left: 6px; }\n  .indent2 { padding-left: 14px; }\n  .signatures {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-top: 60px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .signatur